track gpnStar
shortLabel GPN-Star
longLabel GPN-Star genomic language model constraint scores (primate, mammal, vertebrate)
superTrack on
pennantIcon New red ../goldenPath/newsarch.html#TBD "Released TBD"
dataVersion GPN-Star scores, Hugging Face revision 47e7f05 (September 2026)
group compGeno

track gpnStarLlr
shortLabel GPN-Star -LLR
longLabel GPN-Star -LLR per alternate allele (primate, mammal and vertebrate models)
parent gpnStar
priority 1
compositeTrack on
html gpnStar
dataVersion GPN-Star scores, Hugging Face revision 47e7f05 (September 2026)
type bigWig
subGroup1 model Model P=Primate_(243) M=Mammal_(447) V=Vertebrate_(100)
subGroup2 allele Mutation A=A C=C G=G T=T
dimensions dimX=allele dimY=model
maxWindowToDraw 10000000
mouseOverFunction noAverage
autoScale off
alwaysZero on
viewLimits -3:10
viewLimitsMax -16:16
negateValues on
yLineOnOff on
yLineMark 0
graphTypeDefault bar
maxHeightPixels 100:16:16
windowingFunction mean+whiskers
visibility dense

